Autogenerated BSB by bsb2usfm 3.1 2 John The Second Letter of John 2 John 2Jn
## The Second Letter of
## John
2JN 1
## A Greeting from the Elder
[2JN 1:1] The elder,
To the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in the truth — and not I alone, but also all who know the truth — [2JN 1:2] because of the truth that abides in us and will be with us forever:
[2JN 1:3] Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, will be with us in truth and love.
## Walking in the Truth
[2JN 1:4] I was overjoyed to find some of your children walking in the truth, just as the Father has commanded us. [2JN 1:5] And now I urge you, dear lady — not as a new commandment to you, but one we have had from the beginning — that we love one another. [2JN 1:6] And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments. This is the very commandment you have heard from the beginning, that you must walk in love.
## Beware of Deceivers
[2JN 1:7] For many deceivers have gone out into the world, refusing to confess the coming of Jesus Christ in the flesh. Any such person is the deceiver and the antichrist. [2JN 1:8] Watch yourselves, so that you do not lose what we have worked for, (1:8 NE and WH what you have worked for) but that you may be fully rewarded. [2JN 1:9] Anyone who runs ahead without remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God. Whoever remains in His teaching has both the Father and the Son.
[2JN 1:10] If anyone comes to you but does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your home or even greet him. [2JN 1:11] Whoever greets such a person shares in his evil deeds.
## Conclusion
[2JN 1:12] I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not to do so with paper and ink. Instead, I hope to come and speak with you face to face, (1:12 Literally mouth to mouth) so that our joy may be complete.
[2JN 1:13] The children of your elect sister send you greetings. (1:13 BYZ and TR include Amen.)
